$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Septa Scarabae IV" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Foggy & Raining" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle one another at close quarters.  Each team must take the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touching it to their own flag to capture.  The first team with eight captures shall be the victor! There is also a center objective that gives an offensive/defensive edge. Capture it for one point." @
         "\n\n<f1>Designed by: <f0> bosshog" @
         "\n\n<f1>Special Thanks: <f0> Earthworm thanks for all the hard work with the tutorials. Could not of done it with out you! Check out Earthworms section at (www.tribesworld.com) Pokey you were my encouragement to try to make a great map! Pokeys Playhouse at (http://maroon.smsu.edu/J/jiw592s/) Thanks a bunch guys!";
         